{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Reed Drink: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja20'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 20 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sīlavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ethics </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>10. Naḷapānajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Reed Drink: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Disvā padamanuttiṇṇaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Seeing footprints go down into the water, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Disvānotaritaṁ padaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and none that return, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Naḷena vāriṁ pissāma, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>we shall drink water through a reed: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Neva maṁ tvaṁ vadhissasī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>no way shall you kill me. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Naḷapānajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Sīlavaggo dutiyo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Atha lakkhaṇa sākha dhiratthu puna, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Na kiratthi rasehi kharādiyā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Atibhoti vara māluta pāṇa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Muccena naḷaavhayanena bhavanti dasāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
